Package: keyboardeer
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: KeyboarDeer contributors
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0
Description: Visual keyboard configuration companion for kmonad-device-manager
 KeyboarDeer provides a VIA-style interface for configuring keyboards through
 KMonad. It interoperates with kmonad-device-manager for device access,
 validation, and process supervision.
 .
 Installs a desktop entry registered as the default application for
 *.kbdprofile.json profile files.
